 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Take care",
   "texto": [
    "**Беречь** (care, protect) carries the acusative complement: **беречь природу** (care for nature). To say what to do, **нужно** + infinitive is used: **Нужно сортировать мусор** (you have to separate the waste).",
    "**Чтобы** + infinitive expresses the purpose: **чтобы беречь природу** (to care for nature)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Causes and for all",
   "texto": [
    "**Из-за** + genitive (for the cause): **из-за загрязнения воздуха** (for air pollution). **Для** + genitive (for): **для всех** (for all).",
    "**Загрязнение** (pollution) goes into genitive when it indicates what: **загрязнение воздуха** (air pollution)."
   ]
  },
